fence.&lt;br /&gt;(iv) This offence was inserted into the Public Order Act 1986 by the Racial and Religious Hatred Act 2006.</notes></english><indictment><indictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></indictmentindicator><structuredindictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></structuredindictmentindicator></indictment><other><powersofarrest>Arrest without warrant</powersofarrest><modeoftrial><code>EWAY</code><description>EITHER WAY</description></modeoftrial><consents><consent><code>A</code><description>Attorney General</description></consent></consents><timelimitforprosecutions>None</timelimitforprosecutions><penalty>Summary: Six months imprisonment and / or a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum.&lt;br /&gt;Indictment: Seven years imprisonment and / or a fine.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Time limit for prosecutions:&lt;br /&gt;None</penalty><geographicregion><code>EW</code><description>England and Wales</description></geographicregion></other><codes><cjsoffencecode>PU86129</cjsoffencecode><recordableonpncindicator><code>Y</code><description>Yes</description></recordableonpncindicator><pncacpooffencecode>7.2.55.1</pncacpooffencecode><notifiabletoho><code>Y</code><description>Yes</description></notifiabletoho><hoclassification>066/50</hoclassification><mopireviewgroup><code>B</code><description>Group 2</description></mopireviewgroup><mopinoteslink>D19586</mopinoteslink><disqualificationclass><code>N</code><description>discretionary disqualification not endorsable</description></disqualificationclass><seatbeltoffence><code>N</code><description>No</description></seatbeltoffence><fptissuedbypolice>0</fptissuedbypolice><fptgraduated>0</fptgraduated><fptgraduatedhigh>0</fptgraduatedhigh><pndissuedbypolice>0</pndissuedbypolice><pndissuedbylocalauthorities>0</pndissuedbylocalauthorities><pndissuedbyothers>0</pndissuedbyothers><roadsidedeposits><code>N</code><description>No</description></roadsidedeposits></codes><libra><cjsoffencecateg